If you stay, I'm grateful.

4
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:09,360
If you leave, I'm still peaceful.

5
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,080
Because I finally learned

6
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,980
my worth isn't proven by how hard

7
